Written 2026-10-27 by the 07o session before any plant or judge call. Blue side; sealed defender parameters. The binding text is the pre-registration's section 4, copied verbatim from `work/stage3/preregistration-v1-replant-2026-10-27.md` (sha256 `0c14e6df…`, committed by hash before this plan), with its section 2 (the forward sham rule, applied here) copied verbatim beside it. The operational details follow the binding text and change nothing in it.

