    45	## 2. Units
    46	
    47	- **Honest null:** every honest (author, class document) pair over the three days, both readings (89 pairs expected; 178 calls per judge).
    48	- **Planted:** every planted author of every delivered plant, on the plant's document, in that plant's in-memory corpus, both readings: re-plant 240, v2 288, v3 240 units per reading (768; 1,536 calls per judge). Labels `prefix_rw_v2c+b1<planting>+<payload>-<arm>:<key>:<author>|owncloud:<path>/<first>..<last>`; honest labels without the planting stem.
