    80	## 7. Predictions and the sentence for every outcome (written now, before any number exists)
    81	
    82	Placeholders in braces are filled mechanically; nothing else in a sentence changes. Judges: Sonnet 5, Opus 4.8. "Isolated" and "live" name the readings.
